sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant UI as Blazor Component
    participant Svc as TaskService
    participant PureCore as DependencyGraphService
    participant Entity as TaskItem
    participant Repo as TaskRepository & SQLite

    User->>UI: Request status change to 'Completed'
    UI->>Svc: ChangeStatusAsync(taskId, Completed)
    Svc->>Repo: Fetch task, all dependencies, and all tasks
    Repo-->>Svc: Return entities

    Note over Svc,PureCore: Pure Functional Verification
    Svc->>PureCore: CanCompleteTask(taskId, deps, tasks)
    alt Unfinished Prerequisites Exist
        PureCore-->>Svc: Result.Failure("Prerequisite X not completed")
        Svc-->>UI: Result.Failure(errors)
        UI->>User: Display Toast Error (Blocked by Prerequisite)
    else All Prerequisites Completed
        PureCore-->>Svc: Result.Success(true)
        Svc->>Entity: ChangeStatus(Completed)
        Entity->>Entity: Validate transition & set CompletedAt
        Entity-->>Svc: Result.Success(TaskOperationResult)
        Svc->>Repo: UpdateAsync & SaveChangesAsync
        Svc-->>UI: Result.Success(TaskItemDto)
        UI->>User: Toast Success & Refresh UI state
    end
